## Coding Conventions for New Packages

- All models use Pydantic v2 with strict type hints
- Services are async classes with `__init__(self, db_pool, redis, ...)` signatures
- Use `structlog` for logging with context-rich fields
- Import config from `app.swarm_config import swarm_settings`
- Every service file includes a docstring citing the relevant patent claim(s)
- ZEFCP/Quakete constants go in their respective `constants.py` files
- Use `from app.models.zefcp import ...` and `from app.models.quakete import ...` for model imports
